{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/1098685-recruiting-for-new-vtm-campaign-transylvania-or-giovanni-chronicles-chat-pbp","id":1098685,"title":"Recruiting for New VtM Campaign! Transylvania or Giovanni Chronicles - Chat/PbP","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-31T00:36:38-07:00","id":1098685,"title":"Recruiting for New VtM Campaign! Transylvania or Giovanni Chronicles - Chat/PbP","content":"Hello everyone,<br /> <br /> I\u2019m looking for a group to launch an online Vampire: the Masquerade campaign. My goal is to find 2-4 players who are able to meet weekly (or biweekly) via chat, and to supplement those meetings with play by post sessions.<br /> <br /> The group will play through the Transylvania Chronicles, due both to interest in the setting and alleviating pressure from the ST. I\u2019m very keen on the idea of a century-spanning campaign - one that starts in the Dark Ages and runs until modernity - and I hope others are too! We could also consider the Giovanni Chronicles based on group preference.<br /> <br /> For rules, I suggest V20 with the Dark Ages supplement - but I\u2019m open on this. Mechanics mean much less to me than group dynamic or story.<br /> <br /> On a final (and rather important) note: <b>I am looking for an experienced Storyteller to lead this group</b>. While I\u2019ve run campaigns in the past, I no longer have the time to do a game like this justice. That said, I\u2019m happy to help recruit, organise and otherwise support - but this game will ultimately be the ST\u2019s to run with. If no one is available, I <i>may</i> be able to step up - but let's see first. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> If interested, please respond with some information about yourself. I will reply to this post with an application template to help find the right people. Simply fill in your details and I\u2019ll get back to you ASAP. Thanks for reading! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> \u2026<br /> <br /> Tl;dr - looking for a 2-4 players and ST to run an online, module-based VtM campaign. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13516-wod_berlin","name":"wod_berlin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-31T01:36:13-07:00","id":1098692,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"><b>Recruitment Template:</b><br /> <br /> Name: <i>Will</i></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Age: <i>29</i></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Timezone: <i>CET</i></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Player/ST: <i>Player, potentially ST if needed</i></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Brief Bio: <i>Twenty something living in Germany with a penchant for escapism</i></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Gaming Experience: <i>I ran tabletop games in high school, everything from 