span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Brief Bio: <i>Originally from Brazil, I now live in Dallas TX. I'm a programmer by trade and a <b>long</b> time follower of o/nWoD</i></span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Gaming Experience: </span></span><i><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">I had a group I played with in Brazil over a decade ago, but since then I have been mainly following the materials and hoping I would eventually find the right group again. I look for most in a group the interest in exploring themes and crafting a compelling story, rather than comedic </span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px\">escapism</span><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\"> or power trips.</span></span></i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Availability: <i>Live sessions are hard since work can be very unpredictable. I can, however, commit to <u>at least</u> 1 post per day, 5 days a week, in PbP format.</i></span></span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:11px\">Anything Else: <i>I have not touched oWoD since 2001, so I am very rusty on it. However, I just picked up the V20 and V20 Dark Ages books and I am reading through them.</i></span></span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2611-guiskj","name":"guiskj","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2611